"""Editorial question designs for prospective off-Earth settlements."""

from review_angle_plans import audit, revise_domain


MOON = """history_origins|From Lunar Mission to Settlement Idea|How did short-stay missions become long-presence proposals?|Trace dated architecture documents.
famous_examples|A Named Lunar Habitat Concept|Which parts have been tested, funded, or flown?|Distinguish concept from operation.
hidden_stories|Labor behind Lunar Presence|Who designs, trains, repairs, and monitors a lunar mission from Earth?|Use credited operations records.
beginner_explainers|Mission, Outpost, or Civilization?|What duration, population, and institutions distinguish these?|Define criteria before applying label.
advanced_concepts|Lunar Logistics and Redundancy|How do launch cadence, spares, and return options affect survival?|Model one supply chain.
mysteries_unsolved_cases|A Lunar Resource Promise|What evidence would show a deposit can support usable production?|Separate detection, extraction, and processing.
technology_innovation|A Lunar Life-Support Test|What performance has a subsystem demonstrated?|State setting, duration, and failure mode.
people_personalities|A Lunar Crew Member's Work|Which choices and constraints appear in a mission account?|Use attributed primary account.
major_events|A Lunar Program Decision|How did funding or architecture change a surface plan?|Compare dated agency documents.
how_it_works|A Lunar Outpost's Daily Systems|How do power, water, air, food, and repairs connect?|Map dependencies and reserves.
rise_fall|A Lunar Base Proposal Shelved|What cost, policy, or technology limit changed the plan?|Read decision history.
then_vs_now|Apollo Stays and Future Presence|What capabilities remain unproven for months of occupancy?|Compare duration and support.
future_developments|A Plausible Lunar Presence|Which tested capabilities and repeated funding are required?|State conditional stages.
myths_vs_facts|Can Moon Ice Supply a Colony?|What is known about location, grade, extraction, and delivery?|Avoid treating detection as availability.
documentary_stories|A Lunar Architecture Revision|How did objectives, hardware, and budget change?|Build dated source trail.
assumption_inventory|A Lunar Settlement Scenario|Which launch, power, radiation, and governance assumptions are hidden?|List failure-sensitive premises.
readiness_check|Before Longer Lunar Occupancy|Are rescue, spares, life support, and medical plans tested?|Use mission criteria.
physical_limits|Night, Dust, and Radiation|How do local environment and location constrain a habitat?|Use measured site data.
governance_choice|Who Governs Lunar Activities?|How do state responsibilities and partner agreements operate?|Use treaty and current agreements.
unequal_futures|Who Benefits from Lunar Investment?|How are scientific access, contracts, and costs distributed?|Read budgets and participation.
scenario_pair|Two Lunar Surface Strategies|How do short rotating crews and prolonged habitation differ?|Hold science objective fixed.
failure_to_launch|A Lunar Hardware Delay|Which interface, test, or funding gap affected schedule?|Use milestone evidence.
unintended_effect|Surface Activity and Science|Could dust, traffic, or extraction damage a study site?|Assess specific footprint.
social_adaptation|Life with Earth Delay and Isolation|What team practices support a lunar crew?|Use analogs with limits stated.
ethical_boundary|Protecting Lunar Heritage Sites|How should activity near historical sites be constrained?|Use documented protections.
signal_vs_hype|Outpost Rendering versus Working Habitat|What hardware and operational evidence exists?|Separate plan, test, and flight.
reversible_steps|A Lunar Mission Exit Plan|How could a crew leave or safely shut down systems?|Check contingency and return path.
field_resource_budget|A Lunar Consumables Ledger|How much mass, energy, and water does a stated crew need?|Include loss and backup.
field_habitat_design|Shelter on a Lunar Site|How do shielding, temperature, dust, and maintenance shape design?|Specify location.
field_governance_model|Authority at a Lunar Outpost|Who decides safety, science access, and disputes?|Map mission and treaty roles.
field_dependency_chain|When a Lunar Delivery Fails|Which systems fail first and what reserves remain?|Stress-test cadence.
field_social_inclusion|Participation in Lunar Decisions|Which nations and communities can shape priorities?|Compare decision access and contracts.
"""

